patrol_positions.description:
Watch {camera} in another dashboard tab. Submit a direction to jog, wait until stopped, then name and capture the current position. Repeat for the next position. Visit saved positions to verify their views. Patrol repeats in listed order, from last back to first; this is not a hard boundary. Zoom is unchanged. Positions: {count}

{positions}

Save requires 2–32 positions including two distinct coordinates. Cancel discards edits, but does not undo physical movement or restart patrol.
